==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid66_4Sub.svg|24px]] '''Silk ControlGrid66_4Sub''' command creates a blended corner grid, a ControlGrid66_4Sub object from 4 [[Image:Silk_SubGrid33_2Grid64.svg|16px]] [[Silk_SubGrid33_2Grid64|corner sub-grids]] to close a gap surrounded by 4 [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid64_2Grid44.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlGrid64_2Grid44|blended edge grids]].

[[File:20.-ControlGrid66_4Sub_in.png|200px]]

{{Caption|Four SubGrid33 partial grids around a four-sided corner hole, before joining}}

[[File:20.-ControlGrid66_4Sub_out.png|200px]]

{{Caption|The finished ControlGrid66_4Sub filling the corner hole}}

[[Image:Silk_Workflow-32.png|300px]] [[Image:Button_right.svg|12px|link=]] [[Image:Silk_Workflow-33.png|300px]]

{{Caption|4 selected [[Silk_SubGrid33_2Grid64|corner sub-grids]] → Resulting blended corner grid filling the corner gap}}

==Usage==

# Select 4 related [[Image:Silk_SubGrid33_2Grid64.svg|16px]] [[Silk_SubGrid33_2Grid64|corner sub-grids]] in a loop.
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_ControlGrid66_4Sub.svg|16px]] ControlGrid66_4Sub}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid66_4Sub.svg|16px]] ControlGrid66_4Sub}} option from the menu.
# A '''ControlGrid66_4Sub''' object, is created.

== Properties ==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

A blended corner grid, a '''ControlGrid66_4Sub''' object, is derived from a [[Part_Feature|Part feature]], or more precise a {{Incode|Part::FeaturePython}} object, and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional properties:

=== Data ===

{{Properties_Title|ControlGrid66_4Sub}}

* {{PropertyData|Legs|Part::PropertyGeometryList}}: Control segments.
* {{PropertyData|Poles|VectorList}}: Poles.
* {{PropertyData|SubGrid_0|Link}}: First reference 3X3 sub-grid.
* {{PropertyData|SubGrid_1|Link}}: Second reference 3X3 sub-grid.
* {{PropertyData|SubGrid_2|Link}}: Third reference 3X3 sub-grid.
* {{PropertyData|SubGrid_3|Link}}: Fourth reference 3X3 sub-grid.
* {{PropertyData|Weights|FloatList}}: Weights.


